␀␀␀␀current␀temperature_2m␀␀apparent_temperature␀␀␀␀weather_code␀␀␀␀wind_speed_10m␀␀is_day␀␀daily␀␀␀temperature_2m_max␀␀temperature_2m_min␀␀precipitation_probability_max␀␀␀sunrise␀sunset␀␀hourly␀␀precipitation_probability␀␀␀https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com/v1/search?count=1&language=en&name=␀␀␀␀results␀latitude␀␀␀␀longitude␀␀␀YouTube channels need the YouTube Data API key.␀Add at least one YouTube or Twitch channel.␀pin2␀␀␀␀nopin␀␀␀PINs don't match␀␀␀␀Type the same PIN in both boxes. Nothing was saved.␀PIN too short␀␀␀Use at least 4 characters. Nothing was saved.␀␀␀	␀␀␀Missing details␀Check the network settings␀␀A fixed IP needs a valid IP and gateway, e.g. 192.168.1.250 and 192.168.1.1.␀␀␀␀pref␀␀␀␀rm␀␀No Wi-Fi network␀␀␀␀Too many networks␀␀␀You can save up to 5. Remove one first.␀Add at least one Wi-Fi network.␀http␀␀␀␀sumHour␀wxtown␀␀Town not found␀␀Couldn't find "␀". Try a nearby town or add the country, e.g. "Paisley, UK".␀␀␀␀spsecret␀␀␀␀nightStart␀␀nightEnd␀␀␀␀Saved &#10003;␀␀The board is restarting and will join whichever saved network is in range.␀␀Saved!␀␀Restarting...␀␀␀Basic ␀␀https://accounts.spotify.com/api/token␀␀Can't reach Spotify␀Content-Type␀␀␀␀application/x-www-form-urlencoded␀␀␀error_description␀␀␀access_token␀␀␀␀expires_in␀␀refresh_token␀␀␀grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=␀https://api.spotify.com/v1␀␀/me/player?market=from_token␀␀␀␀Not connected␀␀␀Spotify error ␀␀is_playing␀␀progress_ms␀volume_percent␀␀item␀␀␀␀duration_ms␀artists␀show␀␀␀␀album␀␀␀images␀␀width␀␀␀/me/player/pause␀␀␀␀/me/player/play␀PUT␀/me/player/next␀POST␀␀␀␀/me/player/previous␀/me/player/volume?volume_percent=␀␀␀Volume ␀Needs Spotify Premium␀␀␀No active device␀␀␀␀code=␀␀␀No code found in what you pasted␀␀␀␀grant_type=authorization_code&code=␀Spotify connected &#10003;␀␀Long-press the board's screen and choose Spotify.␀␀␀Couldn't connect Spotify␀␀␀␀. Codes only work once and expire after a few minutes &ndash; open the Spotify link again and paste the new address.␀␀␀␀Spotify not connected␀␀␀Spotify said: ␀␀<h1>Spotify connected &#10003;</h1><p>Long-press the board's screen and choose Spotify.</p><a href='/'>Go to the dashboard</a></div></body></html>␀␀. Press Connect Spotify on the settings page to try again.␀␀client_id=␀␀Twitch: add your Client ID and Secret in settings␀␀␀&client_secret=␀&grant_type=client_credentials␀␀https://id.twitch.tv/oauth2/token␀␀␀Twitch: Client ID or Secret is wrong␀␀␀␀Twitch: can't sign in (␀login=␀␀users?␀␀login␀␀␀display_name␀␀␀␀profile_image_url␀␀␀created_at␀␀Twitch channel not found␀␀␀␀Twitch error ␀␀␀channels/followers?first=1&broadcaster_id=␀␀total␀␀␀user_id=␀␀␀␀streams?␀␀␀␀user_id␀viewer_count␀␀␀␀started_at␀␀game_name␀␀␀thumbnail_url␀␀␀{width}␀320␀{height}␀␀␀␀180␀update check␀␀␀␀network: update check␀␀␀Spotify command␀network: Spotify command␀␀␀␀channel counts␀␀network: channel counts␀live streams␀␀␀␀network: live streams␀␀␀profile pictures␀␀␀␀network: profile pictures␀␀␀latest videos␀␀␀network: latest videos␀␀comments␀␀␀␀network: comments␀␀␀new video tracker␀␀␀network: new video tracker␀␀typical views␀␀␀network: typical views␀␀weather␀network: weather␀␀␀␀network: Spotify␀␀␀␀recent uploads␀␀network: recent uploads␀phone notifications␀network: phone notifications␀␀␀␀closing connections␀network: closing connections␀␀␀␀idle␀␀␀␀network: idle␀␀␀NOT found␀␀␀Touch controller %s
